<h2 id="what-is-gohighlevel">🏋️ What Is GoHighLevel?</h2>

GoHighLevel (often called GHL or HighLevel) is an all-in-one sales and marketing platform originally built for agencies but increasingly adopted by fitness businesses. It consolidates CRM, email marketing, SMS campaigns, funnel building, appointment scheduling, reputation management, and even website hosting into a single dashboard.

Unlike purpose-built gym management software like <a href="/reviews/gym-management-software">PushPress or Wodify</a>, GoHighLevel wasn't designed specifically for fitness. It's a horizontal platform that gym owners must configure for their specific needs. This flexibility is both its greatest strength and most significant weakness.

The platform gained massive traction in the fitness industry through agencies selling "done-for-you" marketing systems to gym owners. Many operators first encounter GoHighLevel through these white-labeled versions before realizing they can subscribe directly.

